{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:content:placeholder:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:transaction:content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncImage","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4ViewP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This view uses the shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URLSession"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance to load an image from the specified URL, and then display it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can display an icon that’s stored on a server:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["AsyncImage(url: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/icon.png\"))","    .frame(width: 200, height: 200)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Until the image loads, the view displays a standard placeholder that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fills the available space. After the load completes successfully, the view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates to display the image. In the example above, the icon is smaller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the frame, and so appears smaller than the placeholder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can specify a custom placeholder using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:content:placeholder:)"},{"type":"text","text":". With this initializer, you can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to manipulate the loaded image."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can add a modifier to make the loaded image resizable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["AsyncImage(url: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/icon.png\")) { image in","    image.resizable()","} placeholder: {","    ProgressView()","}",".frame(width: 50, height: 50)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For this example, OpenSwiftUI shows a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView"},{"type":"text","text":" first, and then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image scaled to fit in the specified frame:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can’t apply image-specific modifiers, like","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Image\/resizable(capInsets:resizingMode:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", directly to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Instead, apply them to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Image","type":"reference"},{"text":" instance that your ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure gets when defining the view’s appearance.","type":"text"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To gain more control over the loading process, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:transaction:content:)"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer, which takes a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" closure that receives an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImagePhase"},{"type":"text","text":" to indicate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the state of the loading operation. Return a view that’s appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current phase:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["AsyncImage(url: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/icon.png\")) { phase in","    if let image = phase.image {","        image \/\/ Displays the loaded image.","    } else if phase.error != nil {","        Color.red \/\/ Indicates an error.","    } else {","        Color.blue \/\/ Acts as a placeholder.","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/asyncimage"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncImage","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"AsyncImage","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncImage"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI10AsyncImageV"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view that asynchronously loads and displays an image."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/s9EscapableP":{"title":"Swift.Escapable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/AsyncImage/init(url:scale:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"url","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scale","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AsyncImage\/init(url:scale:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Loads and displays an image from the specified URL."}],"title":"init(url:scale:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/asyncimage\/init(url:scale:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/AsyncImage/View-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/asyncimage\/view-implemen